jumped forward in time three months?

00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:53.360
You'd be like, oh my god what happened?

00:05:53.360 --> 00:05:58.500
So, I am expecting episode 8 to pick up almost immediately after the end of episode 7.

00:05:58.500 --> 00:06:03.200
I know a lot of you guys are asking if Supreme Leader Snoke is connected to Emperor Palpatine.

00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:08.600
If Emperor Palpatine was the Emperor of the galaxy, and one of the most powerful dark side force users

00:06:08.600 --> 00:06:12.400
of all time, then how could Snoke, albeit you know a very powerful person himself,

00:06:12.400 --> 00:06:14.539
have absolutely no knowledge of him.

00:06:14.539 --> 00:06:18.560
So I think that in the movies they will
reference Palpatine, but my understanding

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:23.300
based on what JJ Abrams has said, is that Snoke doesn't have any kind of connection with Palpatine.

00:06:23.330 --> 00:06:27.200
So that's why I don't think he's Darth Plagueis or anybody from the expanded universe.

00:06:27.260 --> 00:06:30.380
I know everybody wanted to know if he
might have been Plagueis, like secretly

00:06:30.380 --> 00:06:32.500
some other figure who was behind Palpatine.

00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:36.470
I think that he definitely is bigger than
Palpatine, but i think that the context

00:06:36.470 --> 00:06:40.010
is very different. I think what JJ Abrams
wants to say is that Palpatine, was just

00:06:40.010 --> 00:06:46.000
like a small part of the pie that is the Force. So definitely expect them to reference Darth Sidious and the Sith,

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:50.200
but i don't think that their plans have anything to do with what the Sith were doing.

